                        "entry_id": "b3433751-9d30-323b-91ba-eb07fd1d81e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A gas composed of 10% ethylene oxide on a carrier of 90% carbon dioxide, used for sterilization."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f847f5a8-3d19-4f74-abde-5ad9d3545edf",
                                "sense_id": "6b2cf2e0-7362-3694-916d-1709e089b217",
                                "text": "Closure should be as airtight as possible in order to reduce leakage of carboxide to a minimum."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c9ecc50-21f3-412b-a9e3-41032a58df8e",
                                "sense_id": "6b2cf2e0-7362-3694-916d-1709e089b217",
                                "text": "Also, carboxide requires a gasproof chamber to be effective."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fb1d1f2-a36f-4776-8b0e-19a464030834",
                                "sense_id": "6b2cf2e0-7362-3694-916d-1709e089b217",
                                "text": "Carboxide has been used as an aircraft fumigant in Canada by Air Canada and other air carriers ."
